{
  "text": "You run the business. Boss runs the busy work. This is where the line between those two gets drawn. Type a job, give it a date, and it sits here. Drag it into today or into later. Drag it above another one to say which comes first. Read more opens the whole thing out. And help. Help is the handover. Tap it and the job stops being yours and becomes the team's. That's the point of this list. Not that it remembers things that you can give them away.",
